       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Q1 2021: No progress yet

Q2 2021: 
Indicator 1,2,3,4: no progress yet. 
Preparatory works have been initiated including finalization of TOR for selecting the responsible parties.

Q3 2021: 
Indicator 1,2,3, 4: no progress yet. 
One semi-government entity (SMEPS) was selected for provision of business and technical skills for MSMEs.

Q4 2021: 
1.There is no progress for 2021, as the process is linked to value chain studies that are conducted early 2022. However, 
potential smallholders and SMEs are under identification. 
2. Seven (7) value chain sectors identified in collaboration between the private sector and local authorities in Hadhramaut and Aden and it is expected to reach out 700 small and medium enterprises.
